{
  "id": "GEN.26",
  "number": "26",
  "bookId": "GEN",
  "reference": "Genesis 26",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "26",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 26"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "26",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now there was a famine in the land, besides the former famine that was in the days of Abraham. And Isaac went to Gerar, to Abimelech king of the Philistines. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to him, and said, “Do not go down to Egypt; dwell in the land of which I shall tell you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sojourn in this land, and I will be with you, and will bless you; for to you and to your descendants I will give all these lands, and I will fulfil the oath which I swore to Abraham your father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will multiply your descendants as the stars of heaven, and will give to your descendants all these lands; and by your descendants all the nations of the earth shall bless themselves: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because Abraham obeyed my voice and kept my charge, my commandments, my statutes, and my laws.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Isaac dwelt in Gerar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the men of the place asked him about his wife, he said, “She is my sister”; for he feared to say, “My wife,” thinking, “lest the men of the place should kill me for the sake of Rebekah”; because she was fair to look upon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When he had been there a long time, Abimelech king of the Philistines looked out of a window and saw Isaac fondling Rebekah his wife. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abimelech called Isaac, and said, “Behold, she is your wife; how then could you say, ‘She is my sister’?” Isaac said to him, “Because I thought, ‘Lest I die because of her.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abimelech said, “What is this you have done to us? One of the people might easily have lain with your wife, and you would have brought guilt upon us.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Abimelech warned all the people, saying, “Whoever touches this man or his wife shall be put to death.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Isaac sowed in that land, and reaped in the same year a hundredfold. The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " blessed him, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and the man became rich, and gained more and more until he became very wealthy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He had possessions of flocks and herds, and a great household, so that the Philistines envied him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Now the Philistines had stopped and filled with earth all the wells which his father's servants had dug in the days of Abraham his father.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Abimelech said to Isaac, “Go away from us; for you are much mightier than we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So Isaac departed from there, and encamped in the valley of Gerar and dwelt there. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Isaac dug again the wells of water which had been dug in the days of Abraham his father; for the Philistines had stopped them after the death of Abraham; and he gave them the names which his father had given them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But when Isaac's servants dug in the valley and found there a well of springing water, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the herdsmen of Gerar quarreled with Isaac's herdsmen, saying, “The water is ours.” So he called the name of the well Esek,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Contention",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " because they contended with him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they dug another well, and they quarreled over that also; so he called its name Sitnah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26.21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Enmity",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he moved from there and dug another well, and over that they did not quarrel; so he called its name Rehoboth,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26.22",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "That is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Broad places",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Room",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " saying, “For now the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " has made room for us, and we shall be fruitful in the land.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "From there he went up to Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " appeared to him the same night and said, “I am the God of Abraham your father; fear not, for I am with you and will bless you and multiply your descendants for my servant Abraham's sake.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he built an altar there and called upon the name of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and pitched his tent there. And there Isaac's servants dug a well.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Abimelech went to him from Gerar with Ahuzzath his adviser and Phicol the commander of his army. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaac said to them, “Why have you come to me, seeing that you hate me and have sent me away from you?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They said, “We see plainly that the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is with you; so we say, let there be an oath between you and us, and let us make a covenant with you, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that you will do us no harm, just as we have not touched you and have done to you nothing but good and have sent you away in peace. You are now the blessed of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So he made them a feast, and they ate and drank. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the morning they rose early and took oath with one another; and Isaac set them on their way, and they departed from him in peace. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That same day Isaac's servants came and told him about the well which they had dug, and said to him, “We have found water.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 26:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gen 21.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " He called it Shibah; therefore the name of the city is Beer-sheba to this day.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.26.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.26.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
